    "era": "1967-present",
    "bio": "Founded 1967. Governing body for amateur surfing on the East Coast of the United States. Runs district and regional contests from Maine to Florida. ESA Regionals is a major proving ground for East Coast talent. Organized competitive surfing for generations of East Coast athletes.",
