    "bio": "Mundaka in the Basque Country of northern Spain is home to Europe's most celebrated left-hand river-mouth barrel. When conditions align — typically October through December — Mundaka produces long, hollow tubes that travel several hundred meters along a sandbar formed at the mouth of the Gernika estuary. The wave hosted the CT Billabong Pro Mundaka event for many years until inconsistent sand conditions led to the event's relocation. It remains a bucket-list destination for tube-seekers worldwide.",
