    "bio": "Robby Naish is widely regarded as the greatest windsurfer of all time. Born in La Jolla, California, and raised on Maui, he won his first world windsurfing title at age 13 in 1976 and went on to win 24 world titles across divisions. He later pioneered kitesurfing, winning the first Kite World Tour titles and helping establish the sport commercially. Naish International, his family equipment company, remains one of the most respected brands in wind-powered watersports. He is a central figure in the lineage connecting surf, windsurf, and kitesurf culture.",
