    "bio": "Save The Waves Coalition is an international nonprofit organization dedicated to protecting the coastal environments that create surf breaks. Founded in 1999 and based in Santa Cruz, California, Save The Waves manages the World Surfing Reserves program, which grants formal protected status to globally significant surf breaks such as Malibu, Ericeira, Manly Beach, and others. The organization works with local communities, governments, and surf organizations to prevent development and environmental degradation near protected surf zones.",
