    "bio": "The Surf Ranch in Lemoore, California is the premier artificial wave facility in the world, developed by Kelly Slater and the WSL Wave Company (formerly Kelly Slater Wave Company). Using a submerged foil sled that travels along a track, the facility generates a perfectly consistent, barreling wave nearly 700 meters long on both left and right-hand sides. The WSL has held CT events at the Surf Ranch, and it has been used for athlete training and content creation. Its success has inspired a global industry of artificial wave parks.",
